==Hebrew==
{{he-rootbox|ס־ג־ס־ג}}
{{he-root|ס|ג|ס|ג|tr=s-g-s-g}}. Like the verb {{m|he|סגסג|tr=sigség|gloss=to alloy}}, from {{m|he|סיג|tr=sig|gloss=dross, base metal}} through [[reduplication]]<ref name="klein1">{{R:CEDHL|435|סגסג}}</ref>, in turn derived from {{m|he|סוג|tr=sug|gloss=kind, class}}<ref name="klein2">{{R:CEDHL|442|סִיג}}</ref>, with original verbal meaning of "to turn away, reject" as well as "to hem in, bind, fence in".<ref name="strongs5472">{{R:Strong's|H|5472}}</ref><ref name="strongs5473">{{R:Strong's|H|5473}}</ref>. See also: {{m|he|סייג|tr=siyég|gloss=to enclose, fence in}}.

